      "writtenOn": "2020-09-15T17:13:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "With the operation handle being a binder token this is not possible.\n\nPlease instead describe the behavior of calling update, finish, or abort after having called abort.\n\nI would suggest the following: If an operation was finalized, calling update, finish, or abort yields ErrorCode::INVALID_OPERATION_HANDLE. An operation is finalized if finish or abort was called on it, or if update returned an ErrorCode.",
